{%- style -%}
  .hk-press-sec { padding: 100px 5%; background: #fff; font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .hk-press-top { display: flex; gap: 60px; margin-bottom: 80px; align-items: center; }
  .hk-press-img { width: 50%; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
  .hk-press-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .hk-press-content { width: 50%; }
  .hk-press-title { font-family: 'Bodoni Moda', serif; font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 30px; color: #111; }
  .hk-press-list { list-style: disc; padding-left: 20px; color: #333; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 16px; }
  .hk-press-logos { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #EBE7E2; padding-top: 60px; }
  .hk-press-logo { text-align: center; }
  .hk-press-logo h3 { font-family: 'Bodoni Moda', serif; font-size: 24px; color: #111; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .hk-press-logo p { font-size: 13px; color: #777; line-height: 1.5; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .hk-press-top { flex-direction: column; } .hk-press-img, .hk-press-content { width: 100%; } .hk-press-logos { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
{%- endstyle -%}
<div class="hk-press-sec">
  <div class="hk-press-top">
    <div class="hk-press-img"><img src="{{ 'vellano_suds.png' | asset_url }}" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600" alt="Vellano Suds"></div>
    <div class="hk-press-content">
      <h2 class="hk-press-title">For hair and skin that feel like they used to.</h2>
      <ul class="hk-press-list">
        <li>88% noticed softer hair and skin*</li>
        <li>85% noticed less frizzy and brittle hair*</li>
        <li>79% noticed less skin dryness and sensitivity*</li>
        <li>Longer-lasting hair colour</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px; color: #999;">*Vellano Consumer Perception Trial</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hk-press-logos">
    <div class="hk-press-logo"><h3>VOGUE</h3><p>Hard water leaves a film of metal, chlorine and impurities... Screw onto your shower hose for softer, less frizzy hair.</p></div>
    <div class="hk-press-logo"><h3>Women's Health</h3><p>My hair and skin have completely transformed. I still use the same shampoo, but the only thing that's changed? The water.</p></div>
    <div class="hk-press-logo"><h3>Good Housekeeping</h3><p>Since investing in Vellano's filtered shower head six months ago, my hair feels softer, less tangled and stronger again.</p></div>
    <div class="hk-press-logo"><h3>The Sun</h3><p>A total breeze to install too, with no tools required. Fits directly onto your existing hose.</p></div>
  </div>
</div>
{% schema %}{ "name": "Press Editorial", "presets": [{"name": "Press Editorial"}] }{% endschema %}